Tetris, in Cosole mode. 

Clone the repo and execute it with Go. 

go run main.go

## Run in a container

Build the image:

```sh
docker build -t terminal-tetris .
```

Run with an interactive terminal:

```sh
docker run --rm -it terminal-tetris
```

On Linux, pass through the host sound device to enable music:

```sh
docker run --rm -it --device /dev/snd:/dev/snd terminal-tetris
```

Without an available sound device, the game runs without music.

